<span id="S3.T2.2.2.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top">
<span id="S3.T2.2.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">The commenter’s <span id="S3.T2.2.2.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">target_attribute</span> can be inferred from the following comment.</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="S3.T2.2.3" class="ltx_tr">
