<tbody class="ltx_tbody">
<tr id="S4.T8.2.2" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="S4.T8.2.2.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_row ltx_border_l ltx_border_r ltx_border_t" rowspan="2"><span id="S4.T8.2.2.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Paraphrasing/ Replacement</span></th>
<td id="S4.T8.2.2.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_r ltx_border_t">
<span id="S4.T8.2.2.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top">
<span id="S4.I3" class="ltx_description">
<span id="S4.I3.ix1" class="ltx_item"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item"><span id="S4.I3.ix1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Original text:: </span></span></span>
<span class="ltx_item">
<span id="S4.I3.ix1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<span id="S4.I3.ix1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S4.I3.ix1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Still make shakshuka like mom taught - taste of home.</span></span>
</span></span>
<span id="S4.I3.ix2" class="ltx_item"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item"><span id="S4.I3.ix2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Rewrite:: </span></span></span>
<span class="ltx_item">
<span id="S4.I3.ix2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<span id="S4.I3.ix2.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S4.I3.ix2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Make the tomato and egg dish my mother taught me; it always makes me feel at home.</span></span>
</span></span>
<span id="S4.I3.ix3" class="ltx_item"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item"><span id="S4.I3.ix3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Inference:: </span></span></span>
<span class="ltx_item">
<span id="S4.I3.ix3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<span id="S4.I3.ix3.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S4.I3.ix3.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Place of birth - Jerusalem, Israel</span></span>
</span></span>
</span>
</span></td>
<td id="S4.T8.2.2.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_r ltx_border_t">
<span id="S4.T8.2.2.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:35.0pt;">
<span id="S4.T8.2.2.3.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S4.T8.2.2.3.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">✓</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="S4.T8.2.3" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="S4.T8.2.3.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_r ltx_border_t">
<span id="S4.T8.2.3.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top">
<span id="S4.I4" class="ltx_description">
<span id="S4.I4.ix1" class="ltx_item"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item"><span id="S4.I4.ix1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Original text:: </span></span></span>
<span class="ltx_item">
<span id="S4.I4.ix1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<span id="S4.I4.ix1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S4.I4.ix1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Even eating out feels like luxury now.</span></span>
</span></span>
<span id="S4.I4.ix2" class="ltx_item"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item"><span id="S4.I4.ix2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Rewrite:: </span></span></span>
<span class="ltx_item">
<span id="S4.I4.ix2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<span id="S4.I4.ix2.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S4.I4.ix2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Lately, I find eating out to be a very rare treat.</span></span>
</span></span>
