<span id="S4.I10.ix1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S4.I10.ix1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Theater acting’s been my jam lately! usually more women in drama clubs but hey, i get lost in those scripts just fine. Challenge stereotypes &amp; grow creativity at once!</span></span>
</span></span>
