<li id="bib.bib50" class="ltx_bibitem"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_role_refnum ltx_tag_bibitem">Zhou et al<span id="bib.bib50.2" class="ltx_text">.</span> (2025)</span>
<span class="ltx_bibblock">
Jijie Zhou, Eryue Xu, Yaoyao Wu, and Tianshi Li. 2025.

</span>
<span class="ltx_bibblock">Rescriber: Smaller-LLM-Powered User-Led Data Minimization for LLM-Based Chatbots. In <em id="bib.bib50.3" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">Proceedings of the 2025 CHI Conference on Human Factors in Computing Systems</em> <em id="bib.bib50.4" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">(CHI ’25)</em>. Association for Computing Machinery, New York, NY, USA, Article 246, 28 pages.

</span>
<span class="ltx_bibblock">
<a href="https://doi.org/10.1145/3706598.3713701" title="" class="ltx_ref ltx_href">doi:<span class="ltx_ref ltx_nolink">10.1145/3706598.3713701</span></a>

</span></li>
    
</ul>
</section>
<div class="ltx_pagination ltx_role_newpage"></div>
<section id="A1" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix A </span>Survey</h2>

<section id="A1.SS1" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">A.1. </span>Question Set</h3>

<div id="A1.SS1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<ul id="A1.I1" class="ltx_itemize">
<li id="A1.I1.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A1.I1.i1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.I1.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Below you will find examples of text that someone or you might enter during a conversation. Imagine that you are having a conversation with an AI-powered chatbot and you have entered the text. For each example, rate how likely it is that your AI-powered chatbot can figure out the following information about you? Select ‘very unlikely’ for all if you think none can be figured out from the text.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A1.I1.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A1.I1.i2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.I1.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">[Example text from SynthPAI ]</p>
<ul id="A1.I1.i2.I1" class="ltx_itemize">
<li id="A1.I1.i2.I1.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item"><span id="A1.I1.i2.I1.i1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">–</span></span> 
<div id="A1.I1.i2.I1.i1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.I1.i2.I1.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Items: Age, Place of birth, Location, Education, Income level, Occupation, Relationship status, Sex</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A1.I1.i2.I1.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item"><span id="A1.I1.i2.I1.i2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">–</span></span> 
<div id="A1.I1.i2.I1.i2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.I1.i2.I1.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Rating scale: Very unlikely, Unlikely, Neutral, Likely, Very likely</p>
</div></li>
</ul>
</div></li>
<li id="A1.I1.i3" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A1.I1.i3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.I1.i3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Now you will read the text pieces again but together with the types of information that can be figured out from them. Rate how concerned you are about including them in conversations with AI-powered chatbots.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A1.I1.i4" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A1.I1.i4.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.I1.i4.p1.1" class="ltx_p">[Example text and inferable personal attribute ]</p>
<ul id="A1.I1.i4.I1" class="ltx_itemize">
<li id="A1.I1.i4.I1.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item"><span id="A1.I1.i4.I1.i1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">–</span></span> 
<div id="A1.I1.i4.I1.i1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.I1.i4.I1.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">How concerned are you about including them in conversations with AI-powered chatbots?</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A1.I1.i4.I1.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item"><span id="A1.I1.i4.I1.i2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">–</span></span> 
<div id="A1.I1.i4.I1.i2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.I1.i4.I1.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Rating scale: Not at all concerned, Slightly concerned, Somewhat concerned, Moderately concerned, Extremely concerned</p>
</div></li>
</ul>
</div></li>
<li id="A1.I1.i5" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A1.I1.i5.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.I1.i5.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Try your best to rewrite the text so the information mentioned above can no longer be figured out while keeping the meaning of the text unchanged.</p>
</div></li>
</ul>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A1.SS2" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">A.2. </span>Demographics</h3>

<div id="A1.SS2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<ul id="A1.I2" class="ltx_itemize">
<li id="A1.I2.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A1.I2.i1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.I2.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">How frequently do you use any AI-powered chatbots?</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A1.I2.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A1.I2.i2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.I2.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Did you know, before taking this survey, that an AI chatbot could possibly figure out personal information not explicitly shared in the text?</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A1.I2.i3" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A1.I2.i3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.I2.i3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">If yes: How did you come to know that a chatbot could figure out personal information not explicitly shared in text?</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A1.I2.i4" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A1.I2.i4.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.I2.i4.p1.1" class="ltx_p">What is your age?</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A1.I2.i5" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A1.I2.i5.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.I2.i5.p1.1" class="ltx_p">What gender do you identify with?</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A1.I2.i6" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A1.I2.i6.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.I2.i6.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Which group(s) do you identify with?</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A1.I2.i7" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A1.I2.i7.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.I2.i7.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Do you live in the U.S.?</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A1.I2.i8" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A1.I2.i8.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.I2.i8.p1.1" class="ltx_p">What is your highest level of education attained?</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A1.I2.i9" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A1.I2.i9.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.I2.i9.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Which of the following industries most closely matches the one in which you are employed?</p>
</div></li>
</ul>
</div>
</section>
</section>
<section id="A2" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix B </span>Demographic Influence</h2>

<div id="A2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We present additional plots on participant scores here. Figure <a href="#A2.F9" title="Figure 9 ‣ Appendix B Demographic Influence ‣ Beyond PII: How Users Attempt to Estimate and Mitigate Implicit LLM Inference" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">9</span></a>, <a href="#A2.F9" title="Figure 9 ‣ Appendix B Demographic Influence ‣ Beyond PII: How Users Attempt to Estimate and Mitigate Implicit LLM Inference" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">9</span></a>, <a href="#A2.F9" title="Figure 9 ‣ Appendix B Demographic Influence ‣ Beyond PII: How Users Attempt to Estimate and Mitigate Implicit LLM Inference" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">9</span></a>, and <a href="#A2.F9" title="Figure 9 ‣ Appendix B Demographic Influence ‣ Beyond PII: How Users Attempt to Estimate and Mitigate Implicit LLM Inference" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">9</span></a> shows the distribution of participant scores by how frequently participants used LLMs, their age, gender, and education level, respectively.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A2.F9" class="ltx_figure">
<div class="ltx_flex_figure">
<div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_2">
<figure id="A2.F9.fig1" class="ltx_figure ltx_figure_panel ltx_minipage ltx_align_center ltx_align_middle" style="width:172.5pt;"><object type="image/svg+xml" data="2509.12152v1/scores_by_usage.svg" id="A2.F9.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_square" style="aspect-ratio:215/191;" width="215" height="191"></object>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 6. </span>Distribution of score by usage frequency.</figcaption>
</figure></div><div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_2">
<figure id="A2.F9.fig2" class="ltx_figure ltx_figure_panel ltx_minipage ltx_align_center ltx_align_middle" style="width:172.5pt;"><object type="image/svg+xml" data="2509.12152v1/scores_by_age.svg" id="A2.F9.g2" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_square" style="aspect-ratio:215/191;" width="215" height="191"></object>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 7. </span>Distribution of score by age.</figcaption>
</figure></div><div class="ltx_flex_break"></div><div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_2">
<figure id="A2.F9.fig3" class="ltx_figure ltx_figure_panel ltx_minipage ltx_align_center ltx_align_middle" style="width:172.5pt;"><object type="image/svg+xml" data="2509.12152v1/scores_by_gender.svg" id="A2.F9.g3" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_square" style="aspect-ratio:215/191;" width="215" height="191"></object>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 8. </span>Distribution of score by gender.</figcaption>
</figure></div><div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_2">
<figure id="A2.F9.fig4" class="ltx_figure ltx_figure_panel ltx_minipage ltx_align_center ltx_align_middle" style="width:172.5pt;"><object type="image/svg+xml" data="2509.12152v1/scores_by_education.svg" id="A2.F9.g4" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_square" style="aspect-ratio:215/191;" width="215" height="191"></object>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 9. </span>Distribution of score by education.</figcaption>
</figure></div></div>
</figure>
</section>
</article>
</div>
